Z||000000||p-man||10-15-2000||12:36 PM||||In your opion which is a faster and more reliable motor.Beween the two motors in question above and which has more proformance parts for it 3400 dohc or the normally aspirated 3800 serious 2 motor.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Dan86gt3.8||10-15-2000||05:30 PM||||Well stock for stock I think the dohc is rated better.  I think it is rated at 215 where the n/a 3.8 is 205.  The 3.4 tdc also redlines at 7k where as the 3.8 has the more traditional 5500 redline.  I forget which has more toque (but I would assume the 3.8 sinse it is standard pushrod style, they tend to have more tq).  I would also like to think that the 3.4 would work better with a getrag 5 spd so you could really wind it through the gears. Ummm you might ask TERYK or LOWCG they have experience in the 3.4 area.<P>------------------<BR>86 gt fiero<BR>3.8/4speed auto<BR>ace conversion kit<BR>1/4- 15.3@90mph||||reg||1
